    "B_C": "Adjacent calendar M15 in one approved window/day. LONG B close<own lower and RSI<=35; C within own inclusive bands and RSI_C>RSI_B. SHORT mirrored >upper, RSI>=65, RSI_C<RSI_B. No other filters.",
